    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the Advanced Jack&Jill prelim during Augsburg Westie Station 2025 in  Germany at 10/23/2025.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Maxime Zzaoui, Joshua Schubert, Jula Palenga, Torri Zzaoui, Florian Hamm, Attila Kobori, Torri Zzaoui, Camille Lange, Alyssa McKeever and Sean McKeever.    </div></section>

